Package: EPhysMEA
Type: Package
Title: Analysis Tools for Multichannel Electrophysiology
Version: 0.2.1
Author: person("Moritz", "Lindner", email = "moritz@lindnerlab.de", role =
    c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The EPhysMEA package is an environment for working with microelectrode array data in R providing binning and trial aggregation, tuning and receptive-field analysis, Naka-Rushton fitting, spike-train irregularity metrics, and ggplot2-based visualisation.
